&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Notre équipe&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Sports&lt;/strong&gt; recherche un·e &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;41&quot;&gt;Software Engineer Android &lt;/strong&gt;basé·e à&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;68&quot;&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre sens : &lt;strong&gt;&quot;Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all.&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Chez Decathlon, notre ambition est claire : rassembler autour du sport et rendre le bien-être accessible au plus grand nombre. &lt;br&gt;Pour donner vie à cet objectif, nous nous appuyons sur deux forces majeures :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nos coéquipiers, qui sont le cœur battant de notre écosystème.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Notre ancrage local, qui nous lie à chaque communauté sportive pour offrir des solutions uniques (produits, services et expériences).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour propulser cette vision, le Digital est un levier clé.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ton futur terrain de jeu : la Digital Sport Unit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Véritable trait d&#39;union entre nos marques sportives et le digital, cette équipe conçoit les solutions de demain. &lt;br&gt;En nous rejoignant, tu auras un impact direct : tu contribueras à créer et déployer des produits, services et expériences digitales pour simplifier le quotidien de nos coéquipiers et enchanter la pratique de nos utilisateurs sportifs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le &lt;strong&gt;Connected Locker&lt;/strong&gt;, c&#39;est le cœur logiciel qui fait le pont entre tous nos produits physiques (vélos, tapis, montres) et l&#39;écosystème digital de Decathlon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ton défi ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Absorber la complexité.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Chaque produit a ses propres protocoles et spécificités hardware ; le rôle du CL est d&#39;unifier tout cela dans une librairie&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;modulaire&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;et robuste pour que les développeurs d&#39;applications (Decathlon HUB, Mobility..) puissent intégrer n&#39;importe quel équipement en quelques lignes de code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TES MISSIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architecture Modulaire &amp;amp; Design de SDK :&lt;/strong&gt; Concevoir et faire évoluer une architecture Kotlin découplée et évolutive, permettant d&#39;ajouter de nouveaux types de produits sans réécrire le cœur du système..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;onnectivité Hybride &amp;amp; IoT :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtriser le stack Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) sous Android (gestion des cycles de vie, scans, reconnexions, spécificités constructeurs/ROMs) pour le local, et le MQTT/REST pour la communication Cloud&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement d&#39;une &quot;Test App&quot; :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Développer et maintenir une application de test dédiée (Jetpack Compose).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Permettre aux QA de valider les fonctionnalités du SDK en isolation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer des outils de simulation (mocking) pour tester les cas d&#39;erreurs hardware difficiles à reproduire en réel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Abstraction (L&#39;Art du SDK Android) :&lt;/strong&gt; Créer des API publiques simples et idiomatiques (Kotlin Coroutines / Flow) pour masquer la complexité des machines d&#39;états hardware aux applications utilisatrices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Langage :&lt;/strong&gt; Kotlin (100%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Asynchronisme :&lt;/strong&gt; Coroutines, StateFlow / SharedFlow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Connectivité / IoT :&lt;/strong&gt; Android BLE Stack, MQTT (ex: Paho/HiveMQ), AWS IoT Core, REST / WebSockets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;UI (Test App) :&lt;/strong&gt; Jetpack Compose&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Injection :&lt;/strong&gt; Clean Architecture, Dependency Injection (Hilt / Koin)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Outillage / CI-CD :&lt;/strong&gt; Gradle (Build Logic / Version Catalogs), Git, CI/CD pipelines pour publication de SDK/AAR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE DONT TU AS BESOIN POUR RÉUSSIR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es un·e &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;expert·e Kotlin / Android&lt;/strong&gt; avec une vraie &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;52&quot;&gt;vision &quot;Plateforme / SDK&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; (tu penses bibliothèque/AAR recontextualisable avant de penser écran/UI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises le &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;BLE sous Android&lt;/strong&gt; et connais ses pièges (permissions, restrictions arrière-plan, variations selon les versions d&#39;OS/constructeurs), et tu es à l&#39;aise avec les protocoles réseau temps réel (MQTT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une solide expérience en &lt;strong&gt;architecture logicielle&lt;/strong&gt; (Design Patterns, Modularité, Injection de dépendances).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es basé à &lt;strong&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;, prêt à tester ton code sur les machines de sport à 50m de ton bureau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une appétence forte pour le travail en équipe et une culture du partage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un intérêt pour l’impact du sport sur le développement personnel et collectif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’envie de rejoindre une entreprise engagée dans le Tech4Good et l’innovation responsable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POURQUOI NOUS REJOINDRE ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous mettons un point d’honneur à offrir un cadre de travail épanouissant et motivant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride (2 jours de télétravail par semaine);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac, Windows, ou Chromebooks) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, certifications techniques dès la première année, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (participation des employés aux actions de l&#39;entreprise, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Un environnement de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; : entreprise certifiée &lt;strong&gt;Great Place to Work&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Happy Trainees&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Des avantages attractifs&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;(après 3 mois d’ancienneté)&lt;/em&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes mensuelles, intéressement, actionnariat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantages CSE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25% de réduction&lt;/strong&gt; sur nos produits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remboursement de 50%&lt;/strong&gt; du titre de transport &amp;amp; aide à la mobilité urbaine&lt;br&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Un accompagnement sur mesure&lt;/strong&gt; : coaching, formations internes et externes, partage de connaissances.&lt;br&gt;⚡ &lt;strong&gt;Une culture du sport et du test produit&lt;/strong&gt; : deviens ambassadeur.trice de nos innovations et rejoins nos équipes sportives internes !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je ne connais pas le secteur du sport, ai-je ma place chez Decathlon ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien sûr ! Nous recherchons avant tout des personnes &lt;strong&gt;passionnées&lt;/strong&gt; et motivées, que ce soit dans leur domaine d’expertise ou par le sport en général.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Dashlane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;Dashlane’s mission is to deliver the credential security every business and employee needs to thrive. Millions of consumers, and over 25,000 brands worldwide, such as Michelin, Air France, and Forrester, trust Dashlane for industry-leading innovations, patented zero-knowledge security, and an unmatched user experience. Founded in Paris, Dashlane has since established offices in New York and Lisbon, and has grown to more than 300 Dashlaners globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who actively use AI tools to drive efficiency, creativity, and impact in their work. At Dashlane, we drive innovation and value learning, strive for excellence in everything we do, and thrive as one team. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;life at Dashlane&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-work&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we hire&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/benefits-dashlane&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;benefits of being a Dashlaner&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;About-the-role&quot; data-local-id=&quot;af64b56f6739&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2595&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2611&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8bd73118e13e&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Backend Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong security background to join our &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;product development team based in Paris&lt;/strong&gt;, which focuses on building innovative features to &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;enrich the security protection&lt;/strong&gt; for both our B2B and B2C users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2859&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbce58f7e920&quot;&gt;The goal of the team is to research and build product capabilities that improve user protection, strengthen identity and access controls, reduce security risks, and raise the overall security posture of the Dashlane experience. In this role, you will design, build, and operate backend services that power security-sensitive features, working in close partnership with product, design, infrastructure, and the Security organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3293&quot; data-local-id=&quot;57ec8dcb5bb8&quot;&gt;This role is a strong fit for an engineer who has already built security-relevant product features in a SaaS environment, understands application security fundamentals, and can contribute pragmatically to secure, scalable backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1968&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2dd823a4153c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1968&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2dd823a4153c&quot;&gt;You will be based in Paris, with English as your working language. At Dashlane, we embrace a hybrid culture that combines the best of both worlds: the creativity and energy of in-person collaboration with the flexibility of remote work. Our model is designed to strengthen team connections while supporting individual productivity and work-life balance. To maximize collaboration, we come together in the office on Mondays, Tuesdays, and Thursdays, while Wednesdays and Fridays offer more flexibility for focused work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;What-you-will-do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;47c9fa8ec0d4&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3577&quot;&gt;At Dashlane you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a80b7d47d63e&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3597&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f8f0cc0799c1&quot;&gt;Research, design, implement, and maintain backend services that support user-protection features across B2B and B2C products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3726&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a622a42c305e&quot;&gt;Build features related to identity, authentication, access control, threat prevention, and other security-sensitive user journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3860&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88e686f66264&quot;&gt;Work closely with the Product team and the Security team to assess new opportunities, translate security requirements and risk assessments into effective product features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4035&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6221f99ccb5f&quot;&gt;Contribute to threat modeling activities and apply security best practices throughout the software development lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4160&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8bfe816a465e&quot;&gt;Help improve the resilience of systems against common attack patterns such as account abuse, privilege misuse, insecure integrations, and identity-related vulnerabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bd40c3246521&quot;&gt;Participate in architecture discussions and make pragmatic trade-off decisions that balance security, usability, maintainability, and delivery speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4488&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3a9cfeda94ca&quot;&gt;Write high-quality, well-tested, maintainable code and support services in production with appropriate observability and operational ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4635&quot; data-local-id=&quot;468fbbbd6b3b&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional stakeholders to deliver security features that are technically sound and valuable to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;Our-stack&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2eaee8eef9f0&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4768&quot;&gt;Our stack:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98be242c65cd&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4781&quot; data-local-id=&quot;640e725b3082&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Backend:&lt;/strong&gt; Node.js, TypeScript&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4813&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ee9ae117ea8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; AWS, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ECS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RDS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Redis, S3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4857&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ef737510f7a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; GitLab, Terraform, SonarQube&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4898&quot; data-local-id=&quot;de7833bb927f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; ELK, Datadog&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;Requirements&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2989d6371e0c&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4929&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;971d63e77695&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4945&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ab63c58efab7&quot;&gt;Professional experience as a backend software engineer, with hands-on delivery of production systems in a SaaS or similarly cloud-based environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5097&quot; data-local-id=&quot;441b31060b85&quot;&gt;Strong curiosity about security-related topics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5147&quot; data-local-id=&quot;58abb30a59e0&quot;&gt;Strong experience building features that protect users and improve product security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5235&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0d4dba65c526&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of application security best practices, including secure design principles and threat modeling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5354&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e794063497c0&quot;&gt;Experience working closely with a &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;CISO&lt;/span&gt;, Security team, or equivalent security stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5449&quot; data-local-id=&quot;affdc983cfe2&quot;&gt;Proficiency in backend development with modern languages and frameworks, ideally Node.js and TypeScript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5557&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a9da6266ebdc&quot;&gt;Experience designing APIs, integrating external systems, and operating services in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5655&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7ff2e98bf80f&quot;&gt;Good communication skills and the ability to work effectively in a cross-functional environment, particularly with Web/Client engineers, Product Managers, and Product designers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5836&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3a10f2aad933&quot;&gt;Fluency in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;Nice-to-have&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a480f4ed6a8&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5859&quot;&gt;We&#39;re also looking for:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3abfd2642487&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5875&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2c4bbc77926f&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge in cryptography&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5911&quot; data-local-id=&quot;498c19ee1c4e&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Identity and Access Management frameworks and protocols, such as Passkeys, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SAML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, OAuth, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SCIM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, or similar experience in working with other security-related features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6095&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46bb545a6191&quot;&gt;Experience building enterprise security features for administrators and managed business environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6201&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b430fefbce6f&quot;&gt;Experience with authentication hardening, account recovery flows, access governance, or fraud and abuse prevention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6320&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ec8d38a240b&quot;&gt;Familiarity with modern passwordless authentication patterns and user identity lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6424&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a30a0bc1f450&quot;&gt;Experience contributing to security reviews, incident follow-ups, or remediation plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6515&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ecf0fa1bddc1&quot;&gt;Exposure to consumer-scale and business-scale product constraints in the same environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;What-success-looks-like&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dd124770b95a&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6609&quot;&gt;What success looks like:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f7a611f50e1c&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6636&quot; data-local-id=&quot;663f4d03056e&quot;&gt;You deliver backend capabilities that measurably improve user protection and security outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6735&quot; data-local-id=&quot;06282afee734&quot;&gt;You contribute to a strong engineering partnership with the Security organization from early design through production rollout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6866&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e66543bb5645&quot;&gt;You help the new team establish high standards for secure development, system ownership, and practical execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6983&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f5a35625e63b&quot;&gt;You make complex security topics understandable to non-specialists and help turn them into product value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging at Dashlane:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a truly international company—founded in France and &lt;span style=&quot;color: #172b4d;&quot;&gt;distributed across&lt;/span&gt; France, US and Portugal—Dashlane thrives off diverse perspectives. We value all aspects of diversity: gender identity, sexual orientation, ability, ethnic origin, social background, age, lifestyle, and more. We are committed to hiring a diverse community and fostering a culture where everyone is heard and belongs. See more about this &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/diversity&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;d1c12b7e-4df1-44c5-a10f-2644909c66db&quot;&gt;Your interview experience:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To know what to expect once you’ve sent your application, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read about how we interview and hire at Dashlane&lt;/a&gt;. Feel free to browse our blog to find more information about our product and how we work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Dashlane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;Dashlane’s mission is to deliver the credential security every business and employee needs to thrive. Millions of consumers, and over 25,000 brands worldwide, such as Michelin, Air France, and Forrester, trust Dashlane for industry-leading innovations, patented zero-knowledge security, and an unmatched user experience. Founded in Paris, Dashlane has since established offices in New York and Lisbon, and has grown to more than 300 Dashlaners globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who actively use AI tools to drive efficiency, creativity, and impact in their work. At Dashlane, we drive innovation and value learning, strive for excellence in everything we do, and thrive as one team. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;life at Dashlane&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-work&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we hire&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/benefits-dashlane&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;benefits of being a Dashlaner&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;622&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;638&quot;&gt;As a Staff Application Security Engineer, you will play a crucial role in safeguarding Dashlane’s systems and ensuring that our secure development lifecycle remains cutting-edge. Collaborating across all departments, you will advocate for and implement best-in-class security practices, helping millions of Dashlane users enjoy a safer digital life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;930&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Location:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#15372c&quot;&gt;You will be based in Paris, with English as your working language. At Dashlane, we embrace a hybrid culture that combines the best of both worlds: the creativity and energy of in-person collaboration with the flexibility of remote work. Our model is designed to strengthen team connections while supporting individual productivity and work-life balance. To maximize collaboration, we come together in the office on Mondays, Tuesdays, and Thursdays, while Wednesdays and Fridays offer more flexibility for focused work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;930&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Dashlane you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive the continuous improvement of Dashlane’s security program across the product and company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
